"om du har avslutat det aktuella spelet eller inte."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/beginning.page:39
msgid ""
"You can also <link xref=\"15-Puzzle#15-keyboard\">play with the "
"keyboard</link> if you prefer."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också <link xref=\"15-Puzzle#15-keyboard\">spela med "
