#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/beginning.page:41
msgid ""
"After the first time it is opened, <app>Taquin</app> displays a puzzle with "
"the same rules and dimensions as the last one played when it is opened, so "
"it could be a <link xref=\"16-Puzzle\">16-Puzzle</link> game."
msgstr ""
"När du öppnar <app>Taquin</app> igen visas ett pussel med samma regler och "
"storlek som det senast spelade. Det kan alltså vara ett <link "
"xref=\"16-Puzzle\">16-pussel</link>."

